<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Centex raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Centex raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it upgraded Centex Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal 1998 earnings estimate to $3.90 per share from $3.75.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal 1999 earnings estimate to $4.55 per share from $3.45.</p>
<p>-- Set target price of $50 per share.</p>
<p>-- Said majority of 1999 earnings estimate increase due to improved outlook in homebuilding operations.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/16 to 42-15/16.</p>
</text>
